  "name": "Heroic and Mythic Stratholme and Scholomance kills give Argent Dawn reputation (#13374)",
  "contract": "#13374: Player::RewardReputation reads creature_onkill_reputation for the active difficulty template, and none of the Stratholme or Scholomance Heroic (difficulty_entry_1) or Mythic (difficulty_entry_2) templates had a row, so their kills gave no Argent Dawn reputation. rev_20261123_13374_strat_scholo_heroic_mythic_reputation.sql copies each Normal entry's row (faction 529, value and standing cap) to both difficulty templates, as Zul'Gurub's templates do. Three neutral-standing level 60 characters each kill an unowned Skeletal Guardian (10390, Heroic 110390) or Risen Guard (10489, Mythic 210489) in their own instance; the Normal kill is the control. The vanilla reputation migration sets both Normal rewards to 5. Human Diplomacy can raise the gain to 5.5, which the server rounds to 5 or 6 from the zero baseline. The scenario expects that same final range for all three kills at default rates, and before the fix the Heroic and Mythic standings stayed at 0.",
